{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And they shall possess</b> — the people of the Negev: a place-name, or the Negev of the land of Israel, and those who dwell in the Shephelah, as in: \"in the Arabah, in the hill country, in the Shephelah, and in the Negev.\"" "<b>And Benjamin</b> — shall possess Gilead, across the Jordan."], :book :obadiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {0 "The verse reference implied is Deuteronomy 1:7."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Obadiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=18&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:32.712132288Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}